{"steam_appid":1668690,"steam_name":"Alina of the Arena","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1668690/498174/301b751cec99e24492df8138e959b0a5b6c559a8/1751017706/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1665678076","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256906963/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1665678076","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/ss_009a31392773ff457fc8bcd7c36874e10a2f00fa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759815687","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/ss_a4423f6025e96c90a8afcd048b50b108c5afcaa4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759815687","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/ss_2410ff5142aa2edaf3cf3ed8dd790a9c5d4af8cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759815687","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/ss_a4a51a12e7dabd773f4f9ee46b7ae48325161c24.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759815687","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/ss_e6af66e6ae0346ee65be5c75a9bed47f5cf6c886.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759815687"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/7da81e4fe4122b27296678f30886d71e.poster.avif?t=1759815687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/7da81e4fe4122b27296678f30886d71e.webm?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/7da81e4fe4122b27296678f30886d71e.mp4?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><i>'Alina of the Arena'</i> is a roguelike deckbuilding tactics game that combines elements from <i>'Slay the Spire'</i> and <i>'Into the Breach'</i>.<br>Play as a gladiator that must fight for a bloodthirsty crowd to survive. With roguelike deckbuilding and hex-based tactics, players are no longer bound by simple attack and defense. Make use of dodges and knockbacks to stay alive!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/795883190d18f89804cfb4c0245ca7e3.poster.avif?t=1759815687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/795883190d18f89804cfb4c0245ca7e3.webm?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/795883190d18f89804cfb4c0245ca7e3.mp4?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dynamic Deckbuilding</strong><br>Pick up dozens of cards, keep the ones you need, and craft a unique deck as you fight your way through randomized levels that present a different challenge each run!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/84c511f40605752198a93245f91084b2.poster.avif?t=1759815687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/84c511f40605752198a93245f91084b2.webm?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/84c511f40605752198a93245f91084b2.mp4?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Hex-based Tactics</strong><br>Unlike traditional deckbuilders that focus on attack and defense, the tactics element adds a dimension of positioning. Dupe your enemies into attacking each other, or use the terrain to gain an upper hand.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/361ab91ba462d628bf649cb1b21fc7e4.poster.avif?t=1759815687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/361ab91ba462d628bf649cb1b21fc7e4.webm?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/361ab91ba462d628bf649cb1b21fc7e4.mp4?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Dual Equipment System</strong><br>Carry equipment in both hands to enhance your cards! You can dual wield daggers for extra damage, go with a sword &amp; shield combo for rounded performance, or wreak havoc with a two-handed weapon. Figure out the best combination for each fight!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/d680bdbaa843f25a39d9ab73f4021b73.poster.avif?t=1759815687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/d680bdbaa843f25a39d9ab73f4021b73.webm?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668690/extras/d680bdbaa843f25a39d9ab73f4021b73.mp4?t=1759815687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["PINIX"],"publishers":["PINIX","IndieArk"],"release_date":"13 Oct, 2022"}